(text "256Kb (32Kx8) SPI EEPROM, 20 MHz, 1.8-5.5 V, SOIC-8 - AT25256B-SSHL-T (alt 25LC256T-I/SN)\nLAYOUT: 100 nF at VCC (<=2 mm, 100 nF closest), short via to GND plane. Solid GND reference under all SPI traces, no plane splits.\nCLK: 27R source termination within 5 mm of host pin; route CLK first, shortest, >=3W spacing to other nets; no stubs/test points mid-trace.\nSPI <= 20 MHz: keep traces < 100 mm; MISO 0R can become 27R at the EEPROM end if the bus is long.\nTypical use: fast-write parameter storage on an SPI bus. Rename CS# / CLK / IO labels to your nets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "573964e9-800e-4ad3-8c7a-d87396dc33f0"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
